- nasa: fix mission_record filename, labs + flagged readings, local
  Chart.js, pytest tests replace the manual step scripts
- body-dashboard: live link to the hub (hub-bridge.js)
- tests: backend 30 -> 19 files, same 390 tests + 10 hub tests
- docs: README, D-033, data dictionary, CLAUDE.md

